    {
      "id": "claim_5ceb44b7fb4c4bc49f767926fe3eb49d",
      "statement": "getBankVersion selects bank version 2 for SHB (bank ID 12) when the instrument is an shb_account, when the instrument is a card with both month and year provided, or when the client passed a bank_version of '2'; otherwise it returns '1' for SHB and null for all other banks.",
