    {
      "id": "claim_8c8779f8b51d46668232c98695045114",
      "statement": "getFailedReason maps Onecomm transaction response codes to reason JsonObject fields (name/message/details/information_link) by reading onecomm.status.<code>.code and onecomm.status.<code>.desc properties from Main.p; when no mapping exists it falls back to the default reason name ONECOMM_RESPONSE_CODE_NOT_MAP.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/pspconnector/provider/onecomm/OnecommGateway.java#L1669-L1689",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9e7554e2b326175fd5dd36f196ffd7b5d79fe46db47a9fabaf78d93700415e10:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_a389cdcaf6cd49e38a1f02d2c8a55e83",
      "statement": "The bank-aware overload getFailedReason(code, bankId) looks up onecomm.status.<code>.bank.<bankId>.code and .desc properties first, so a bank-specific mapping (for example SHB bank 12 overriding code 24 to ONECOMM_INVALID_TOKEN_INFO) takes precedence over the generic mapping; unmapped bank-specific codes also fall back to ONECOMM_RESPONSE_CODE_NOT_MAP.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/main/java/vn/onepay/pspconnector/provider/onecomm/OnecommGateway.java#L1691-L1711",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b1a900b224e4f4e503a68d106683d24ed6896cc38477b8ea056880acefc8535b:"
