      "statement": "The status-code to failure-reason vocabulary is defined in app.properties: codes 1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 9-14, 21-26, 98, 99, 253, 254 map to distinct ONECOMM_* reason names, and code 100 (or any unmapped code) resolves to ONECOMM_RESPONSE_CODE_NOT_MAP, as exercised by testGetFailedReason_WithoutBank.",
